      <Desc>YMCA of San Diego County - Support numerous youth programs the YMCA of San Diego County offers, including youth development, healthy living, and social responsibility. These programs support healthy development from childhood through adolescence, encompass child care, education and leadership development, swim, sports and play, and camp experiences.</Desc>
